<span id="S5.T3.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Human Acceptance Rate (HAR)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
