<span id="S5.T3.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Proportion of LLM-generated messages accepted by human operators without edits.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T3.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:99.6pt;">
<span id="S5.T3.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Average Edit Distance</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T3.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:165.0pt;">
