</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S7.T5.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S7.T5.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S7.T5.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:91.0pt;">
<span id="S7.T5.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Message Generation Quality</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S7.T5.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S7.T5.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:199.2pt;">
<span id="S7.T5.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Human Acceptance Rate (HAR)</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S7.T5.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S7.T5.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
